sfwbar (1.0~beta17+git20260910+flickos6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * FlickOS patch: start the scanner thread after expr_init() and
    scanner_init() (upstream 88c83b9). It could lock the still NULL
    scan_list first and crash at start, seen now and then when a layout
    switch started the dock.

