sfwbar (1.0~beta17+git20260910+flickos5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * FlickOS patch: follow GSettings' enable-animations instead of
    forcing animations on; a bar whose revealer hides without an
    animation still gets its sensor back.
  * FlickOS patch: WindowInfo() of a taskbar group button (group =
    popup) reads the action's window, so a click on the dock minimizes
    the focused app and raises it again.

